# Aegis fix catalog #111 — Expired / invalid API token
#
# Tier:       4 · Advanced
# Category:   invalid_token (auto-diagnosed from the log below)
# Engine:     reported to the repo owner
#
# CI log:
#   | HttpError: Bad credentials
#   |   status: 401 Unauthorized
#   | token expired or revoked
#
# How it is solved:
#   An expired or revoked token has to be re-issued and saved as a repo secret by its owner. Making the step non-blocking would hide the failure, so Aegis reports it instead.
